Explanation: The theatrical release date in Germany is now 2026-12-03, and PVOD typically follows theatrical by 45 days. Therefore, the earliest PVOD release date would be 2027-01-07 (45 days after 2026-12-03). Since 2027-01-20 is after this date, it is technically possible, but the rights team would need to check if the window for PVOD release has officially opened. Hence, the "window_not_open" constraint indicates that the PVOD release window has not yet officially started.

